    "detailed_description": "The big adventure of a square creature!<br />\r\nIt is a somewhat nostalgic action game drawn with dots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main character, Lifton, doesn't say anything, but he seems to be heading somewhere.<br />\r\nLifton will capture a variety of stages with the help of the enemies around him (while using them).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe feature of this game is to &quot;lift&quot; the enemy.<br />\r\nEnemies picked up by Lifton can be thrown, thrown away, or whatever.<br />\r\nBy the way, some enemies have some effect while increasing or decreasing.",
